{
  "name": "STRIPE---Handler-Subscription-Updated",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STRIPE - Handler Subscription Updated\n\n**Trigger:** Called by STRIPE-Webhook-Handler\n\n**Source:** RFC-025 Section 5.2\n\n**Description:**\nGère les changements de subscription (add/remove items):\n- Détecte les items ajoutés/supprimés\n- Grant/revoke accès en DB\n- Add/remove rôles Discord (via event)\n- Gère les bundles (grant tous les cours)\n- Track acquisition history\n\n**Event:** customer.subscription.updated",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0000",
      "name": "Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "stripe-handler-subscription-updated",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0001",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "stripe-handler-subscription-updated"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// EXTRACT SUBSCRIPTION DATA\n// ============================================\n\nconst input = $input.first().json;\nconst body = input.body || input;\n\nconst eventData = body.event_data || body;\nconst subscription = eventData;\n\n// Extract subscription items (products)\nconst items = subscription.items?.data || [];\nconst currentProducts = items.map(item => ({\n  product_id: item.price?.product || item.plan?.product,\n  price_id: item.price?.id || item.plan?.id,\n  item_id: item.id,\n  quantity: item.quantity || 1\n})).filter(p => p.product_id);\n\nreturn {\n  event_id: body.event_id,\n  customer_id: subscription.customer,\n  subscription_id: subscription.id,\n  subscription_status: subscription.status,\n  current_products: currentProducts,\n  timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n};"
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0002",
      "name": "Extract Subscription Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.API_URL }}/api/users/by-stripe-customer/{{ $json.customer_id }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0003",
      "name": "Get User By Customer ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        640,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// CHECK USER EXISTS\n// ============================================\n\nconst apiResponse = $input.first().json;\nconst subData = $('Extract Subscription Data').first().json;\n\nif (apiResponse.error || apiResponse.statusCode >= 400 || !apiResponse.data) {\n  return {\n    success: false,\n    error: {\n      code: 404,\n      message: `User not found for Stripe customer: ${subData.customer_id}`,\n      status: 'USER_NOT_FOUND'\n    },\n    customer_id: subData.customer_id\n  };\n}\n\nconst user = apiResponse.data || apiResponse;\n\nreturn {\n  success: true,\n  user_id: user.id,\n  discord_id: user.discord_id,\n  guild_id: user.guild_id,\n  customer_id: subData.customer_id,\n  subscription_id: subData.subscription_id,\n  subscription_status: subData.subscription_status,\n  current_products: subData.current_products,\n  event_id: subData.event_id\n};"
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0004",
      "name": "Check User",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-user-success",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0005",
      "name": "User Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ handled: false, error: $json.error }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0006",
      "name": "Response User Not Found",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.API_URL }}/api/users/{{ $json.user_id }}/course-access",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0007",
      "name": "Get Current Access",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        200
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// CALCULATE ACCESS CHANGES\n// ============================================\n\nconst accessResponse = $input.first().json;\nconst userData = $('Check User').first().json;\n\n// Get current DB access (product IDs)\nconst dbAccess = accessResponse.data || accessResponse || [];\nconst dbProducts = new Set(\n  (Array.isArray(dbAccess) ? dbAccess : [])\n    .filter(a => a.status === 'active')\n    .map(a => a.stripe_product_id)\n);\n\n// Get current Stripe products\nconst stripeProducts = new Set(\n  userData.current_products.map(p => p.product_id)\n);\n\n// Calculate differences\nconst toAdd = [...stripeProducts].filter(p => !dbProducts.has(p));\nconst toRemove = [...dbProducts].filter(p => !stripeProducts.has(p));\n\nreturn {\n  user_id: userData.user_id,\n  discord_id: userData.discord_id,\n  guild_id: userData.guild_id,\n  subscription_id: userData.subscription_id,\n  subscription_status: userData.subscription_status,\n  event_id: userData.event_id,\n  current_products: userData.current_products,\n  db_products: [...dbProducts],\n  products_to_add: toAdd,\n  products_to_remove: toRemove,\n  has_changes: toAdd.length > 0 || toRemove.length > 0\n};"
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0008",
      "name": "Calculate Changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1520,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-changes",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.has_changes }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0009",
      "name": "Has Changes?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1740,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ handled: true, message: 'No changes detected', event_id: $json.event_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0010",
      "name": "Response No Changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1960,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// PREPARE GRANT/REVOKE OPERATIONS\n// ============================================\n\nconst data = $input.first().json;\n\n// Prepare API calls for granting access\nconst grantOperations = data.products_to_add.map(productId => ({\n  operation: 'grant',\n  user_id: data.user_id,\n  discord_id: data.discord_id,\n  guild_id: data.guild_id,\n  product_id: productId,\n  subscription_id: data.subscription_id\n}));\n\n// Prepare API calls for revoking access\nconst revokeOperations = data.products_to_remove.map(productId => ({\n  operation: 'revoke',\n  user_id: data.user_id,\n  discord_id: data.discord_id,\n  guild_id: data.guild_id,\n  product_id: productId\n}));\n\nreturn {\n  event_id: data.event_id,\n  user_id: data.user_id,\n  discord_id: data.discord_id,\n  guild_id: data.guild_id,\n  subscription_id: data.subscription_id,\n  operations: [...grantOperations, ...revokeOperations],\n  grant_count: grantOperations.length,\n  revoke_count: revokeOperations.length\n};"
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0011",
      "name": "Prepare Operations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1960,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0012",
      "name": "Split Operations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        2180,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-grant",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.operation }}",
              "rightValue": "grant",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "stripe-sub-updated-0013",
      "name": "Grant or Revoke?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2400,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
